.TH FL-PANEL 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-panel \- taskbar of the fldesktop desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-panel\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the applications button, quick launch buttons, the list of open windows,
an on-screen keyboard button, the network state, the volume, the battery state,
a clock with a calendar and the power menu.
.PP
The volume button talks to PipeWire directly (or uses wpctl/pactl when built
without PipeWire); its popup opens the Sound settings and \fBfl-mixer\fR(1).
The network button shows the wired or Wi-Fi state from NetworkManager and
opens \fBfl-network\fR(1); the panel also asks for Wi-Fi passwords that
NetworkManager needs.
.PP
The panel restarts itself when its settings, the desktop theme or the
compositor configuration change.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/fldesktop/panel.ini\fR
\fB[Panel]\fR QuickLaunch=id;id;..., KeyboardButton=auto|always|never;
\fB[Clock]\fR Format= (strftime format).
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-settings\fR(1), \fBfl-osk\fR(1)
